OL,3,GNEWSAAdoption home records could
OL,4,A'unlock' missing history
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman whose baby was taken from her
OL,7,Fin a forced adoption aged 16 has said
OL,8,Fimportant questions about the UK's
OL,9,Fmother-and-baby homes remain
OL,10,Funanswered, including how many children
OL,11,Fwere buried in unmarked graves.
OL,13,FDiana DeFries, who successfully
OL,14,Fcampaigned for a state apology for
OL,15,Fforced adoptions, said greater access
OL,16,Fto records could help families
OL,17,Funderstand what happened in the homes.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
