OL,3,GNEWSAAdoption home records could
OL,4,A'unlock' missing history
OL,5,
OL,6,FAnd historian Dr Michael Lambert, from
OL,7,FLancaster University, argued that
OL,8,Farchives held privately by religious
OL,9,Fcongregations could help "unlock"
OL,10,Fimportant pieces of history.
OL,12,FDeFries, originally from London, was
OL,13,Fsent by her family to Nazareth House in
OL,14,FSouthampton in 1974 after becoming
OL,15,Fpregnant.
